{
  "source": "Dokumentasi resmi tiap provider (lihat field sources per aturan di catatan model)",
  "checked": "2026-10-15",
  "rules": [
    {
      "endpoint": "google",
      "model": "^(models/)?gemini",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "inputModalities": [
          "text",
          "image"
        ],
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "openai-effort",
          "canDisable": false,
          "defaultOn": true,
          "efforts": [
            "minimal",
            "low",
            "medium",
            "high"
          ],
          "defaultEffort": "medium",
          "lockedWhileActive": []
        },
        "notes": [
          "Reasoning tidak bisa dimatikan pada Gemini 2.5 Pro dan Gemini 3. reasoning_effort dan thinking_config tidak boleh dipakai bersamaan (sumber: ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/openai)."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "xai",
      "model": "^grok",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "stop": false,
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "openai-effort",
          "canDisable": false,
          "defaultOn": true,
          "efforts": [
            "low",
            "medium",
            "high",
            "xhigh"
          ],
          "defaultEffort": "high",
          "lockedWhileActive": [
            "presence_penalty",
            "frequency_penalty"
          ],
          "lockReason": "xAI menolak parameter ini pada model reasoning."
        },
        "notes": [
          "presencePenalty, frequencyPenalty, dan stop ditolak pada model reasoning xAI. Dokumentasi reasoning xAI menjelaskan Responses API; dukungan reasoning_effort di Chat Completions belum terverifikasi (sumber: docs.x.ai/docs/guides/reasoning)."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "qwen",
      "model": "^(qwen|qwq)",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "qwen",
          "canDisable": true,
          "defaultOn": false,
          "efforts": [],
          "budget": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 81920,
            "step": 64
          },
          "lockedWhileActive": []
        },
        "notes": [
          "enable_thinking hanya berlaku untuk model mixed-thinking. Rentang thinking_budget bergantung pada model dan belum terverifikasi; nilai di luar rentang akan ditolak provider."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "zai",
      "model": "^glm",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "zai",
          "canDisable": true,
          "defaultOn": true,
          "efforts": [],
          "lockedWhileActive": []
        },
        "notes": [
          "Thinking aktif secara default (sumber: docs.z.ai)."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "minimax",
      "model": "^MiniMax",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "sampling": {
          "temperature": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 2,
            "step": 0.05,
            "default": 1
          }
        },
        "bodyDefaults": {
          "reasoning_split": true
        },
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "none",
          "canDisable": false,
          "defaultOn": true,
          "efforts": [],
          "lockedWhileActive": []
        },
        "reasoningReplay": "always",
        "notes": [
          "reasoning_split=true selalu dikirim agar reasoning terpisah di reasoning_content. Reasoning wajib dipertahankan utuh di riwayat saat memakai tools (diterapkan di M2). Nilai temperature di luar 0 sampai 2 ditolak; disarankan 1.0."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "mimo",
      "model": "^mimo",
      "patch": {
        "tools": true,
        "reasoning": {
          "style": "none",
          "canDisable": false,
          "defaultOn": true,
          "efforts": [],
          "lockedWhileActive": []
        },
        "reasoningReplay": "with-tools",
        "notes": [
          "Field untuk mengatur thinking belum terdokumentasi di halaman resmi yang diperiksa, jadi kontrolnya tidak ditampilkan. Gunakan Extra body jika kamu tahu nama field-nya.",
          "reasoning_content wajib dikirim ulang pada percakapan dengan tools (diterapkan di M2)."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "openrouter",
      "model": ".*",
      "patch": {
        "reasoningReplay": "with-tools",
        "extras": [
          {
            "key": "provider_sort",
            "label": "Urutan provider",
            "description": "Cara OpenRouter memilih provider untuk model ini.",
            "path": "provider.sort",
            "type": "enum",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "price",
                "label": "Termurah"
              },
              {
                "value": "throughput",
                "label": "Throughput tertinggi"
              },
              {
                "value": "latency",
                "label": "Latensi terendah"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "openrouter",
      "model": "^anthropic/",
      "patch": {
        "promptCache": true,
        "notes": [
          "Prompt ditandai cache_control supaya OpenRouter meneruskan prompt caching ke Claude: input yang sama dibayar lebih murah pada request berikutnya."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "venice",
      "model": ".*",
      "patch": {
        "sampling": {
          "top_k": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 200,
            "step": 1
          },
          "min_p": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "step": 0.01
          },
          "repetition_penalty": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 2,
            "step": 0.05
          }
        },
        "reasoningReplay": "with-tools",
        "extras": [
          {
            "key": "venice_system_prompt",
            "label": "System prompt Venice",
            "description": "Sertakan system prompt bawaan Venice di samping milikmu.",
            "path": "venice_parameters.include_venice_system_prompt",
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true
          },
          {
            "key": "venice_web_search",
            "label": "Web search",
            "description": "Pencarian web oleh Venice. Bisa dikenai biaya tambahan.",
            "path": "venice_parameters.enable_web_search",
            "type": "enum",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "off",
                "label": "Mati"
              },
              {
                "value": "auto",
                "label": "Otomatis"
              },
              {
                "value": "on",
                "label": "Selalu"
              }
            ],
            "default": "off"
          },
          {
            "key": "venice_strip_thinking",
            "label": "Buang blok <think>",
            "path": "venice_parameters.strip_thinking_response",
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "endpoint": "local",
      "model": ".*",
      "patch": {
        "sampling": {
          "top_k": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 200,
            "step": 1
          },
          "min_p": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "step": 0.01
          },
          "repetition_penalty": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 2,
            "step": 0.05
          }
        },
        "notes": [
          "Blok <think>...</think> di dalam jawaban dipisahkan sebagai reasoning secara otomatis."
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
